  <title type="string">Notes on triangles as a form of apology</title>
  <description type="string">Ếlodie O'Shaughnessy talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</description>
